Package: totaljs-fnm
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: ca-certificates, curl, unzip, totaljs-node (>= 1.0.0)
Homepage: https://github.com/Schniz/fnm
Description: fnm, the manager of versions of Node.js, for the Total.js Developer Distros
 Installs fnm (Fast Node Manager) from the pinned release in /usr/share/totaljs-fnm/versions, checked with its
 SHA-256, and puts it in every interactive terminal. The Node.js of the system stays the default; with fnm each
 person installs and uses the other ones (fnm install 22, fnm use 22), and a folder with a .node-version, an
 .nvmrc or an engines field in package.json changes the version by itself when you enter it.
